WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.378 --> 00:00:17.488
The queen wanted the king to make a proclamation.

2
00:00:20.231 --> 00:00:23.693
So he told everyone in the kingdom about the gold plate.

3
00:00:28.757 --> 00:00:32.556
need a brave hero to save the princess," he said.

4
00:00:32.576 --> 00:00:34.997
"Who will volunteer?"

5
00:00:36.317 --> 00:00:37.858
But no one stepped forward.

6
00:00:44.379 --> 00:00:47.260
As time went on, the princess grew sicker.

7
00:00:51.241 --> 00:00:53.102
At last the prince returned.

8
00:00:59.483 --> 00:01:02.537
When he heard the proclamation, his heart leaped.

9
00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:08.541
I can do!"

10
00:01:08.981 --> 00:01:09.482
he thought.

11
00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:13.004
"I'll lose my life.

12
00:01:13.804 --> 00:01:15.966
But without the princess, I have no life.

13
00:01:19.849 --> 00:01:22.570
And I will see her one last time before I die."

14
00:01:25.152 --> 00:01:27.173
The prince dressed like a servant again.

15
00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:30.656
Then he hurried to the palace.

16
00:01:38.796 --> 00:01:41.458
The king stared at the handsome servant before him.

17
00:01:41.478 --> 00:01:45.001
"Tell me what you want, young man."

18
00:01:45.021 --> 00:01:48.384
"I want to be the cork," the prince said.

19
00:01:49.545 --> 00:01:50.506
The king gasped.

20
00:01:50.526 --> 00:01:53.188
"What? You'll be the hero?"

21
00:01:53.208 --> 00:01:58.833
"Yes. I will give my life to return water to the lake," the prince said.

22
00:01:58.853 --> 00:02:00.935
"That's wonderful!"

23
00:02:01.315 --> 00:02:02.036
the king said.

24
00:02:02.056 --> 00:02:06.940
"Would you like to go and see your parents first?"

25
00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:12.641
"No," the prince said.

26
00:02:12.661 --> 00:02:15.342
"But I do have one condition."

27
00:02:15.362 --> 00:02:19.503
"Anything!" the king said.

28
00:02:19.523 --> 00:02:24.344
"I'll climb into the hole," the prince began.

29
00:02:24.364 --> 00:02:29.046
"Then, by magic, water will return to the lake.

30
00:02:30.346 --> 00:02:32.607
When it reaches my head, I will drown."

31
00:02:35.948 --> 00:02:36.868
The king looked down.

32
00:02:38.712 --> 00:02:40.313
"I'm afraid so, yes."

33
00:02:40.333 --> 00:02:44.635
"It will be a long wait," the prince went on.

34
00:02:45.915 --> 00:02:48.516
"Yes." The king bit his lip.

35
00:02:48.536 --> 00:02:50.617
"Waiting is hard.

36
00:02:51.198 --> 00:02:55.299
But with you as cork, the lake will never leak again."

37
00:02:55.319 --> 00:03:00.362
"I want the princess to sit with me," the prince went on.

38
00:03:00.382 --> 00:03:02.963
"She can feed me.

39
00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:05.644
She can look at me now and then to comfort me.

40
00:03:07.448 --> 00:03:10.050
When the water reaches my eyes, she may go."

41
00:03:12.131 --> 00:03:17.495
"I will grant your condition," the king said.

42
00:03:17.515 --> 00:03:20.337
"Now go and prepare yourself.

43
00:03:21.858 --> 00:03:23.839
My guards will search for the hole."

44
00:03:27.922 --> 00:03:30.604
It took the guards a long time to find the hole.

45
00:03:37.344 --> 00:03:40.668
But they finally found it in the center of the lake bed.

46
00:03:41.509 --> 00:03:44.093
It was in the middle of a large stone.

47
00:03:45.695 --> 00:03:48.017
The guards hurried back to tell the king.

48
00:03:52.823 --> 00:03:56.167
It was time to save the lake—and the princess.
